<title>USA: Chantal sues dissident shareholders.</title>
<headline>Chantal sues dissident shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chantal Pharmaceuticals Corp said it filed a suit against dissident shareholders, alleging they violated securities laws and reneging on an agreement to support a new board of directors.</p>
<p>Chantal, which filed the suit in the Southern District Court of New York, also alleged that the dissident shareholders disseminated false information in a bid to drive down Chantal's stock and facilitate a takeover.</p>
<p>The shareholders are seeking to oust the company's chief executive and board of directors.</p>
<p>They filed a motion against the company on June 11.</p>
<p>Chantal's shares closed at 1-5/16 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
